ok - host+hook: a take-over waits out a watcher slow to stop, so a handled wake never resurfaces
ok - host+hook: the next park takes over the cycle a main-only pass-through left, so one arm owns it
ok - host+hook: a park stopped mid take-over leaves the take-over to the next park
ok - host+hook: a successor that cannot be recorded is stopped, and main's next turn end arms a fresh cycle
